    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298016</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_064&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>完了じゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Examination complete.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298088</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_065&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もう、だめ、かも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please...no...more...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298180</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_066&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はぁはぁ……
ちょ……
ひと、やすみ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Haahh...Let us....rest....a little...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298268</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_067&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>終わった……んだよね？
よかった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's over...It's really over? What a relief...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298380</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_068&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あの……洞窟の途中に
閉じ込められてる
妖精がいたんだけド……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh...that's right. Earlier we met a
fairy that got itself trapped...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298476</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_069&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>妖精……？
おお、すっかり
忘れとった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Fairy? Oh! My old mind
almost forgot about it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298620</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_070&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あれ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-What? </EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298620</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_071&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あぁっ！！　おまえ！！
よくも僕を閉じ込めて
くれたな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You! You're the bastard
that trapped me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298720</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_072&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え……
この子を閉じ込めたの
ってマクスウェル？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>M-Maxwell? Why would you do that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298828</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_073&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうじゃ、これに懲りたら
イタズラはよすんじゃぞ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Indeed, I caught the small one
causing trouble for people.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298920</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_074&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やなこったー！！
ベロベロベ～！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Catch me if you can,
ya senile bag o' bones!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298992</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_075&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、ちょっと待って！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, wait a second!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>299180</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_076&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まったく、困ったやつじゃのう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How bothersome...Indeed a
very troublesome individual.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>299180</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_077&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あまりにイタズラが過ぎるから、
閉じ込めておいたんじゃが
あの調子じゃ反省しとらんの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It seems his prison wasn't enough
punishment for his pranks.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>299280</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_078&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>せっかく、
色々教えてもらえると
思ってたのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And here I'd been hoping for
him to teach me some things...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>299428</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_079&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>休憩したら……
&lt;Red&gt;トーティス村&lt;White&gt;に戻んなきゃ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's go...to &lt;Red&gt;Totus&lt;White&gt; and take a rest...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>299428</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_080&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Cless&gt;さんに
会いに行こう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We need to meet with &lt;Cless&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>299516</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_120_060_081&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そう言えば……
そっちもあったね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm so tired...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
